## Hints

- E1: MAD-scaled = 1.4826 × median(|x − median|).
- E4: mean scales with n, SD with √n, so mean/SD scales with √n — the
  ratio grows with aggregation horizon; the honest statement is about
  *comparability across horizons* (annualize before comparing).
